476
00:30:22,447 --> 00:30:23,926
API-003 · 1.

477
00:30:23,926 --> 00:30:26,885
Configuration does not scale; composition does

478
00:30:28,010 --> 00:30:30,951
Each input describes one fixed piece of content.

479
00:30:30,951 --> 00:30:33,526
Every new layout needs a new input,

480
00:30:33,526 --> 00:30:36,100
the inputs interact in ways nobody tested,

481
00:30:36,100 --> 00:30:40,145
