00:31:06,844 --> 00:31:09,872
Individual bugs the configuration style caused

491
00:31:10,997 --> 00:31:15,876
Fixed heading level. h3 is right on some pages and wrong on others.

492
00:31:15,876 --> 00:31:20,380
Heading levels describe the page's outline; a reusable component cannot know it.

493
00:31:20,380 --> 00:31:23,008
A wrong level breaks navigation by headings,

494
00:31:23,008 --> 00:31:26,011
which is how many screen-reader users skim a

495
00:31:26,011 --> 00:31:26,386
page.

496
00:31:26,386 --> 00:31:27,512
Image without alt.

497
00:31:27,512 --> 00:31:32,392
The img has no alt, so some screen readers read the file name.

498
00:31:32,392 --> 00:31:35,394
The card cannot know whether the image is

499
00:31:35,394 --> 00:31:38,022
decorative (alt="") or meaningful. - [innerHTML] body.

500
00:31:38,022 --> 00:31:43,277
Angular sanitizes it, but the sanitizer silently strips content teams expect (styles, many attributes),

501
00:31:43,277 --> 00:31:48,156
and it encourages teams to reach for bypassSecurityTrustHtml, which opens an injection risk.

502
00:31:48,156 --> 00:31:49,658
Projected content needs neither.

503
00:31:49,658 --> 00:31:50,784
Actions as data.

504
00:31:50,784 --> 00:31:55,663
A { label, handler } list cannot express links, menus, icons or aria-label.

505
00:31:55,663 --> 00:31:57,916
Each new need becomes another field.

