00:39:15,614 --> 00:39:18,132
API-004 · Interview question

619
00:39:19,257 --> 00:39:23,151
Match each bug to its cause and fix the component.

620
00:39:23,151 --> 00:39:26,267
Explain the contract between Angular Forms and a

621
00:39:26,267 --> 00:39:29,383
ControlValueAccessor: which direction does each method carry data?

622
00:39:36,033 --> 00:39:40,042
API-004 · The contract · comparison 1

623
00:39:41,167 --> 00:39:42,011
Method: writeValue(value).

624
00:39:42,011 --> 00:39:43,699
Direction: Model to view.

625
00:39:43,699 --> 00:39:48,341
Meaning: "The form's value changed; display it." Must not report back..

626
00:39:49,716 --> 00:39:54,616
API-004 · The contract · comparison 2

627
00:39:55,741 --> 00:39:56,721
Method: registerOnChange(fn).

628
00:39:56,721 --> 00:39:58,681
Direction: View to model.

629
00:39:58,681 --> 00:40:03,581
Meaning: Call fn(value) only when the user changes the value..

630
00:40:04,956 --> 00:40:09,315
API-004 · The contract · comparison 3

631
00:40:10,440 --> 00:40:11,311
Method: registerOnTouched(fn).

632
00:40:11,311 --> 00:40:13,055
Direction: View to model.

633
00:40:13,055 --> 00:40:18,721
Meaning: Call fn() when the user has interacted and left (usually on blur)..

634
00:40:20,096 --> 00:40:24,869
API-004 · The contract · comparison 4

635
00:40:25,994 --> 00:40:26,948
Method: setDisabledState(disabled).

636
00:40:26,948 --> 00:40:28,857
Direction: Model to view.

637
00:40:28,857 --> 00:40:31,721
Meaning: Reflect the control's disabled state..

638
00:40:33,096 --> 00:40:36,497
API-004 · Bug 1: writeValue calls onChange

639
00:40:37,622 --> 00:40:39,675
reset() writes the value to the view,

640
00:40:39,675 --> 00:40:42,901
and the component reports it straight back as if the user

641
00:40:42,901 --> 00:40:43,781
had changed it.

642
00:40:43,781 --> 00:40:47,301
The forms API treats a view change as user input and marks

643
00:40:47,301 --> 00:40:50,821
the control dirty, so the form is dirty immediately after a reset.

644
00:40:50,821 --> 00:40:54,341
It can also cause loops with code that reacts to value changes.

645
00:40:55,716 --> 00:41:00,252
API-004 · Bug 1: writeValue calls onChange

646
00:41:01,377 --> 00:41:04,401
Fix: writeValue only updates what is displayed.

647
00:41:05,776 --> 00:41:09,685
API-004 · Bug 2: OnPush and a plain field

648
00:41:10,810 --> 00:41:15,369
writeValue is called by the forms API, outside any template event of this component.

649
00:41:15,369 --> 00:41:19,602
Under OnPush, setting a plain field does not mark the component for checking,

650
00:41:19,602 --> 00:41:23,835
so the box stays as it was until something else triggers a check.

651
00:41:23,835 --> 00:41:26,441
In a zoneless application it may never update.

652
00:41:27,815 --> 00:41:31,984
API-004 · Bug 2: OnPush and a plain field

653
00:41:33,110 --> 00:41:35,354
Fix: hold the state in a signal.

654
00:41:35,354 --> 00:41:38,561
Setting a signal read by the template schedules the update.

655
00:41:39,936 --> 00:41:43,639
API-004 · Bug 3: no setDisabledState

656
00:41:44,764 --> 00:41:48,466
Angular Forms calls setDisabledState whenever the control's disabled state

657
00:41:48,466 --> 00:41:51,758
changes (and, since Angular 15, also on initialisation).

658
00:41:51,758 --> 00:41:54,638
The method is optional in the interface,

659
00:41:54,638 --> 00:41:57,929
so leaving it out compiles, and disabling does

660
00:41:57,929 --> 00:41:58,341
nothing.

661
00:41:59,716 --> 00:42:04,013
API-004 · Bug 4: touched is never reported

662
00:42:05,138 --> 00:42:09,434
registerOnTouched throws the callback away, so the control never becomes touched.

663
00:42:09,434 --> 00:42:14,120
Any "show errors after the user leaves the field" rule never fires.

664
00:42:15,496 --> 00:42:19,247
API-004 · Bug 4: touched is never reported

665
00:42:20,372 --> 00:42:23,440
Fix: keep the callback and call it on blur.

666
00:42:24,815 --> 00:42:28,326
API-004 · Also: reset() writes null

667
00:42:29,451 --> 00:42:34,996
form.reset() with no value writes null, which the boolean signature hides. checked =

668
00:42:34,996 --> 00:42:40,541
null happens to render as unticked, but anything comparing with === false breaks.

669
00:42:40,541 --> 00:42:43,100
Accept boolean | null and coerce.

